    "Timing: 10–20 min\n2.Prepare Wash medium by supplementing DMEM medium with 1% Penicillin/Streptomycin (Pen/Strep).3.Prepare Complete medium.a.Add 10% fetal bovine serum (FBS) and 1% Pen/Strep into DMEM medium.\nOptional: Filter the complete medium through a Stericup vacuum filtration system (pore size 0.22 μm).\n4.Prepare FACS buffer by adding 5% Horse serum (HS) to Dulbecco’s phosphate-buffered saline (DPBS).\nOptional: In the preparation of FACS buffer, 5% HS can be substituted with 5% FBS."
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "step_id": 0,
      "title": "Prepare 1.2% BaCl2 solution",
      "instruction": "Dissolve barium chloride in sterile 0.9% NaCl saline to a final concentration of 1.2% (w/v), filter the solution through a 0.22 µm filter, aliquot 600 µL portions, store at –20 °C, and use 40 µL per tibialis anterior (TA) or 50 µL per quadriceps (QC) muscle for injection.",
      "substeps": [
        {
          "instruction": "Dissolve BaCl2 in sterile 0.9% NaCl saline to 1.2% w/v.",
          "title": ""
        },
        {
          "instruction": "Filter the solution through a 0.22 µm filter.",
          "title": ""
        },
        {
          "instruction": "Aliquot 600 µL into sterile tubes.",
          "title": ""
        },
        {
          "instruction": "Store aliquots at –20 °C.",
          "title": ""
        },
        {
          "instruction": "Inject 40 µL into TA or 50 µL into QC muscle.",
          "title": ""
        }
      ],
      "is_critical": false,
      "timers": []
    },
    {
      "step_id": 1,
      "title": "Prepare wash medium",
      "instruction": "Supplement DMEM with 1% Penicillin/Streptomycin to create wash medium.",
      "substeps": [],
      "is_critical": false,
      "timers": []
    },
    {
      "step_id": 2,
      "title": "Prepare complete medium",
      "instruction": "Add 10% fetal bovine serum and 1% Penicillin/Streptomycin to DMEM; optionally filter through a Stericup 0.22 µm vacuum filtration system.",
      "substeps": [
        {
          "instruction": "Add 10% FBS to DMEM.",
          "title": ""
        },
        {
          "instruction": "Add 1% Pen/Strep to DMEM.",
          "title": ""
        },
        {
          "instruction": "Optional: filter the complete medium using a Stericup with 0.22 µm pore size.",
          "title": ""
        }
      ],
      "is_critical": false,
      "timers": []
    },
    {
      "step_id": 3,
      "title": "Prepare FACS buffer",
      "instruction": "Add 5% horse serum to DPBS to make FACS buffer; optionally substitute horse serum with 5% fetal bovine serum.",
      "substeps": [
        {
          "instruction": "Add 5% horse serum (HS) to DPBS.",
